              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "payments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Initiates a payment transaction for a selected data package. This triggers an M-Pesa STK push to the customer's phone.\n\n**Request Parameters:**\n- `phoneNumber` (required): Customer's Kenyan phone number in format +254XXXXXXXXX or 0XXXXXXXXX\n- `packageCode` (required): The code of the data package to purchase\n\n**Response:**\n- `merchantReference`: Unique identifier for tracking this transaction\n- `status`: Current status of the transaction (PENDING, RECEIVED, PROVISIONED, FAILED, EXPIRED)\n- `message`: Human-readable status message"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Accepted (STK Push Initiated)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
